14.6. Special Values and Asymptotic Behavior

14.6.1 \(L{>}0\), \(\rho{=}0\)

\(F_{L}{=}0\), \(F_{L}{=}0\)

\(G_{L}{=}\circ\), \(G^{\prime}_{L}{=}\cdots\circ\)

\(L{=}0\), \(\rho{=}0\)

\(F_{v}{=}0\), \(F^{\prime}_{v}{=}C_{0}(\eta)\)

\(G_{0}{=}1/C_{0}(\eta)\), \(G^{\prime}_{0}{=}-\infty\)

\(L{\rightarrow}\alpha\)

\(F_{L}{\sim}C_{L}(\eta)\rho^{t+1}\), \(G_{L}{\sim}D_{L}(\eta)\rho^{-L}\)

\(L{=}0\), \(\eta{=}0\)

\(F_{v}{=}\sin\,\rho\), \(F^{\prime}_{v}{=}\cos\,\rho\)

\(G_{0}{=}\cos\,\rho\), \(G^{\prime}_{0}{=}-\sin\,\rho\)

\(\rho{\rightarrow}\infty\)

\(G_{L}{+}iF_{L}{\sim}\exp\,\bar{\imath}[\rho{-}\eta\ln\,2\rho{-}\frac{L\pi}{2} {+}\sigma_{L}]\)

\(L{\geq}0\), \(\eta{=}0\)

\(F_{L}{=}(\frac{3}{2}\rho)^{\ddagger}J_{L+1}(\rho)\)

\(G_{L}{=}({-}1)^{L}(\frac{3}{2}\pi\rho)^{\ddagger}J_{-\alpha+\ddagger\ddagger \ddagger}(\rho)\)

\(L{\geq}0\), \(2\eta{>>}\rho\)

\(F_{L}{\sim}\frac{(2L+1)!C_{L}(\eta)}{(2\eta)^{L+1}}\,(2\eta\rho)V_{I{L+}[2}(2 \eta\rho)^{\ddagger}]\)

\(G_{L}{\sim}\frac{2(2\eta)^{\ddagger}}{(2L+1)!C_{L}(\eta)}\,(2\eta\rho)^{ \ddagger}K_{L+1}[2(2\eta\rho)^{\ddagger}]\)

