\(F_{v}{\sim}\,e^{-\pi v}(\pi\rho)V_{L}[2(2\eta\rho)^{\ddagger}]\)

\(F^{\prime}_{v}{\sim}e^{-\pi v}(2\pi\eta)^{\ddagger}I_{d}[2(2\eta\rho)^{ \ddagger}]\)

